# The app runs fully client-side against browser storage by default and needs
# NO environment variables to build, run, or deploy.
#
# The variables below are only used if you swap in the optional Postgres/Supabase
# backend described in README.md ("Future improvements: real backend"). They are
# not read by the app as shipped.

# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key
